cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Epistemic Crucible benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Epistemic Crucible: A Generative Developmental Benchmark for Causal Reasoning Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  A generative grid-world benchmark that separates task success from causal
  understanding by pairing each training world with a counterfactual test world that
  preserves the hidden causal rule and breaks the surface cue. It hides causal
  properties behind a strict observation boundary and reports a vector of diagnostic
  metrics with no single aggregate score.
type: software
authors:
